{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56830","headline":"僧伽卒後显形长庆元年夜半於泗州牧苏公寝室前歌（题拟） · 不详","name":"僧伽卒後显形长庆元年夜半於泗州牧苏公寝室前歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮南淮北，自此福焉。\n自东自西，无不熟矣。\n（《宋高僧传》卷十八《广漠泗州普光王寺僧伽传》）（按：僧伽卒於中宗景龙四年，年八十三。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}